WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.980
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:21.150
<i>Fifty years of a man's life</i>

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.520
<i>are like a dream,</i>

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:35.010
<i>compared to the heavens.</i>

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>Once a man is born,</i>

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:48.550
<i>must he not die?</i>

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:52.820
Hachirou... Hibiki...

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.920
We can't let the demon king live!

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:33.000
<b><i>The Cherry Blossoms Scatter</i></b>

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:36.010
Who are you?

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:41.760
Don't you know that you point 
your blades at Nobunaga?

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:43.860
Nobunaga-sama,

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:48.520
you have returned from the land of the dead.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:50.710
The land of the dead?

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:53.650
You say I died?

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:58.900
Nonsense...

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:01.270
I shall never die.

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:07.910
Nobunaga-sama...

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:10.910
Get back, Hibiki!

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:14.670
Stop this, Nobunaga-sama!

00:03:15.050 --> 00:03:15.920
Begone!

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:20.780
Nobunaga-sama...

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:24.220
Who are you people?

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:30.510
Do you work for Mitsuhide... 
that kumquat head?

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:37.440
Burn the monks of Mount Hiei!

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:40.290
I shall conquer China...

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:43.200
And Goa and Malacca, too!

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:48.330
They shall all belong to the
Demon King of the Sixth Heaven!

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:50.280
What are you doing, Hachirou?!

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:52.240
That isn't Nobunaga!

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:53.830
It's just a monster!

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:57.120
Indeed... Right now, he's a monster.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:58.870
But before long,

00:03:58.870 --> 00:04:03.090
he will revive and become the true 
Demon King of the Sixth Heaven.

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:06.010
Hachirou!

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:07.350
Nobunaga-sama!

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:25.330
Die!

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:33.870
Forgive me, Nobunaga-sama.

00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:37.140
The dead must remain dead.

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:13.100
What was that?

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:15.730
Some monster's trick?

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:17.750
Disgusting...

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:20.550
There's no blood within Nobunaga's body.

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:25.260
He's... a puppet. Just a puppet!

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:01.090
Get back, Hachirou! Hibiki!

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:54.140
Namenba!

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.150
That's...

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:08.580
The Lotus Root Gun.

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:32.420
Namenba...

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:34.780
We're getting out of here now.

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:53.200
Get back, Hibiki!

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:17.590
That is as far as you go, Nobunaga-sama.

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:20.430
It's time

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:26.020
for you to return my body.

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:31.600
Right now, I have no mouth.

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:36.910
So I am borrowing yours to speak.

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:40.910
Who is there?

00:08:43.550 --> 00:08:47.730
Kouga Hachirou, Suruga-sama.

00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:52.470
Kouga Hachirou?

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:55.880
Where is Joujin?

00:08:56.290 --> 00:09:00.010
He is gone from this world.

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:04.350
Joujin is... dead?

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:13.280
You laugh, too, Kouga Hachirou!

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:15.780
Suruga-sama?

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:18.450
Laugh at me,

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:23.630
at the destiny which led me to 
be the toy of mere ninjas!

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:31.140
Out of the way, loser!

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:33.420
I am Oda Nobunaga!

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:38.930
I say unto you, Nobunaga-sama...

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:44.930
That, up until the end, 
I refuse to be controlled.

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:47.610
Oda Nobunaga,

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:51.680
return to the hell where Joujin waits!

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:55.070
Mother...

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:59.230
Tadanaga is coming to you now.

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:28.620
The ninjas were nothing but toys, as well.

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:31.100
Let's hurry, Hibiki!

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:31.820
Yeah.

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:58.630
So that is what's left of our dream?

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:03.630
What?

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:10.880
Let's go back...

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:14.520
Master.

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:17.030
To how things were...

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:21.300
Forever... and ever.

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:24.910
Let's just go back...

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:28.360
The corridors of time!

00:11:29.390 --> 00:11:30.980
Fool...

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:33.700
If you do that...

00:11:35.850 --> 00:11:36.870
Where am I?

00:11:37.450 --> 00:11:43.600
This is Rinne Magoroku's technique, 
the Adamantite Tower.

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:48.480
My technique, the Inverted Halberd of Time,

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:52.230
can make time's gears spin backward.

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:55.170
If I scatter all these sands of time,

00:11:55.170 --> 00:11:58.230
there's no knowing how far back we can go.

00:11:58.460 --> 00:12:00.240
Enough! Stop!

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:03.200
Everything is over, Kujaku!

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:19.930
Enough! Stop!

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:22.470
Everything is over, Kujaku!

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:29.970
I'll just have to try!

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:40.730
Your corridor of time flows backward,

00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:44.560
but it must be sealed within 
my Adamantite Tower!

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:05.560
What is this?

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:07.830
I don't know.

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:10.040
What's going on?

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:13.550
Let's just find another path.

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:14.300
Yeah...

00:13:15.990 --> 00:13:17.170
Give up.

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:24.760
Rinne Magoroku!

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:27.030
Is this your doing?!

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:28.920
Half of it.

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:33.560
The real blame lies with Kujaku's 
Inverted Halberd of Time.

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:36.700
And without limit...

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:39.540
Time is flowing backward?

00:13:42.100 --> 00:13:46.710
Perhaps that is why my wounds healed.

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:50.080
But it isn't only time that has gone mad.

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:56.310
I used my Adamantite Tower to stop 
the Inverted Halberd of Time,

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:59.310
and it seems the two clashed 
with one another.

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:02.320
And this is the result, then?

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:05.430
At this point, there is nothing I can do.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:10.710
We have been trapped in a place 
where time and space have gone mad.

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:11.620
Impossible!

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:24.840
Thus, there is only one 
thing left for me to do.

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:27.340
Defeat you.

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.940
You would still fight us?!

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:33.080
Joujin is dead,

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:34.980
and Nobunaga has returned to hell.

00:14:35.480 --> 00:14:39.350
Our blood and tears have 
no meaning to you now!

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:42.070
No, there is no meaning to this.

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:45.610
But I can have my revenge.

00:14:50.010 --> 00:14:53.870
You are angry at the loss 
of your comrades, too.

00:14:54.150 --> 00:14:56.660
And if you defeat me,

00:14:56.660 --> 00:15:00.040
this mad space may return to normal.

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:05.520
Well... I can't guarantee that.

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:09.380
What did you seek when you joined Joujin?

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:13.390
Perhaps I merely wanted a place to fight.

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:23.950
Now, draw your sword!

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:26.280
Or are you afraid?

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:31.920
You don't know if your eyes will 
work in a place like this.

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:34.780
I never had any intention of using them.

00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:43.400
I am Kouga Hachirou. Here I come.

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:46.480
Stand back, Hibiki.

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:09.340
Let's hurry and get out of here.

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:10.750
Right!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:22.440
Saizou!

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:33.780
Let's go. Follow him.

00:17:35.310 --> 00:17:36.100
Hibiki!

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:49.530
Shikibu!

00:17:56.560 --> 00:17:57.410
Hachirou...

00:17:57.410 --> 00:18:01.310
Yes, they're no longer a part of our world.

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:02.870
No...

00:18:04.630 --> 00:18:05.650
Shichigen!

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:09.450
Shichigen!

00:18:24.360 --> 00:18:26.500
Looks like we have to go, too.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:30.260
Yeah. I believe in everyone.

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:34.260
Yes, no matter where this leads us,

00:18:34.950 --> 00:18:37.670
it's where they want us to be.

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:40.170
Let's go, Hachirou.

00:18:40.170 --> 00:18:40.720
Right.

00:19:38.430 --> 00:19:40.650
Truly... hell.

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:48.470
The hell Joujin-sama desired truly 
is in front of us now.

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:58.020
The fire spreads and the castle burns, 
until there's nothing left...

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:02.680
Always a beautiful thing to see.

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:08.410
The daily doings of mankind 
are truly fragile things.

00:20:09.490 --> 00:20:10.660
It isn't enough.

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:13.690
It isn't enough yet.

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:17.720
We must turn this world into a true hell,

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:19.670
starting with Edo.

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:36.760
The town is burning... Edo?

00:20:37.850 --> 00:20:39.200
The Joujinshuu...

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:43.550
You know our name?

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:47.190
The Murakumo reached Edo?

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:51.600
Interesting.

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:55.310
What do you know of us?

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:58.200
Hachirou, is this...

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:01.740
Yes. Saizou, Shikibu, and Shichigen

00:21:02.170 --> 00:21:05.070
were no longer a part of our world.

00:21:05.870 --> 00:21:07.540
In a place where the Adamantite Tower

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:10.190
and the Inverted Halberd of Time intersect,

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:13.600
perhaps anything can happen.

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:17.460
Then what is this place?

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:18.920
I don't know.

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:23.290
I don't know, but perhaps 
it's a different "now"

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:28.320
than the "now" where we fought the 
Joujinshuu and lost our companions.

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:32.090
No matter what world this is,

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:37.540
we can't let Joujin destroy it!

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:42.440
Fortunately, they don't know us.

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:46.800
But we know them.

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:48.030
We can win!

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:26.960
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:26.010 --> 00:23:28.990
Saizou, Shikibu, Shichigen,

00:23:28.990 --> 00:23:32.940
Hachisu, Rui, Utsutsu, Hadaebou,

00:23:32.940 --> 00:23:36.510
Tokugawa Tadanaga, Namenba, Gorone,

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:37.980
<b><i>The Cherry Blossoms Bloom</i></b>

00:23:36.510 --> 00:23:39.180
Iga Hibiki, and Kouga Hachirou...
